<div class="z-bg-umn">
  <div class="tw-relative tw-z-10 tw-max-w-[90em] tw-mx-auto tw-px-8 tw-py-24 tw-text-center">
    <h1 class="tw-text-6xl tw-text-white" data-cy="hero-title">
      <%= t('views.root.hero_text') %>
    </h1>
    <p class="tw-text-2xl tw-text-white tw-mt-4">A short go.gablvm.org address for any page, ready to say out loud, print, or share.</p>
    <% unless signed_in? %>
      <a class="tw-inline-flex tw-py-4 tw-px-8 tw-bg-umn-gold hover:tw-bg-umn-gold-light tw-text-umn-neutral-900 tw-no-underline hover:tw-text-umn-neutral-900 hover:tw-no-underline tw-my-4" href="<%= signin_path %>">
        <%= t('views.root.hero_button') %>
      </a>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="tw-max-w-[90em] tw-mx-auto tw-px-4">
  <div class="umn-post-it tw-relative tw-bg-white tw-my-8 tw-p-8 tw-border before:tw-block before:tw-w-24 before:tw-h-5 before:tw-absolute before:tw-bg-umn-gold before:-tw-top-2 before:tw-left-1/2">
    <h2 class="tw-text-4xl tw-font-semibold">How it works</h2>
    <div class="tw-space-y-4 tw-text-lg tw-text-umn-neutral-700">
      <p>A link like go.gablvm.org/prayer sends people to the full address behind it. GABLVM staff sign in to create links, choose the words, download a QR code, and see how often each one is used.</p>
      <p>If a short link you received does not work, it may have been retired. Write to <a href="mailto:help@gablvm.org">help@gablvm.org</a> and say which link it was.</p>
      <p>This service runs on Z, the open source shortener written at the University of Minnesota, with GABLVM's own sign-in and branding.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
